A compute translation rebuilt because a null pointer slot now holds a buffer (StaleNullPointerSlot)
compiles on a worker; the working translation keeps running until the rebuild is built, instead of
the dispatch waiting for the driver compile (every GPU channel waited with it: 2-3.4 s freezes in
OOT's Hyrule Field). Ported from Nolar-Hack/Lichii 648ac12b7 (the used field it carries is not in
this base).

diff --color -ru a/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_compute_pipeline.h b/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_compute_pipeline.h
--- a/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_compute_pipeline.h
+++ b/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_compute_pipeline.h
@@ -101,6 +101,11 @@
         return precompiled;
     }
     /// Whether the build ended without a pipeline (its module could not be made).
+    /// Whether the driver build has finished (or failed: then IsBound is false)
+    [[nodiscard]] bool IsBuilt() const noexcept {
+        return is_built.load(std::memory_order::acquire);
+    }
+
     [[nodiscard]] bool BuildFailed() const noexcept {
         return is_built.load(std::memory_order::acquire) && !pipeline;
     }
